<title>USA: EZ Communications sells St. Louis station.</title>
<headline>EZ Communications sells St. Louis station.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFAX, Va. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>EZ Communications Inc said on Monday that it sold radio station KSD-AM in St. Louis, Missouri, for $10 million to The Dorsey Group Inc.</p>
<p>&quot;The sale of KSD-AM is a unique opportunity to recognize a return on our $15 million investment for KSD-AM/FM which was purchased primarily for the potential of KSD-FM,&quot; said Alan Box, president and chief executive.</p>
</text>
